"""فحص متصفح لواجهة الهاتف (Mobile UI V1): بيانات وهمية للـAPI، بلا خادم حقيقي. تشغيل: python3 -I tests/browser/mobile_v1_smoke.py"""
import json, os, sys, threading, http.server, functools
from playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright
ROOT = os.path.join(os.path.dirname(__file__), "..", "..", "site")
H = functools.partial(http.server.SimpleHTTPRequestHandler, directory=ROOT)
H.log_message = lambda *a, **k: None
srv = http.server.ThreadingHTTPServer(("127.0.0.1", 8793), H); threading.Thread(target=srv.serve_forever, daemon=True).start()
PLAT = {"ok": True, "dept": {"id": 4046, "name": "طب عام"}, "site": {"department": "طب عام", "university": "جامعة البصرة", "college": "كلية طب الزهراء"},
  "semesters": [{"id": 11, "name": "الكورس الأول", "nameEn": "1st", "current": True}],
  "courses": [{"id": "anat", "semester": 11, "name": "التشريح", "nameEn": "Anatomy", "category": "general", "professors": [{"name": "د. أحمد"}], "lectures": [
     {"number": i, "title": "محاضرة %d" % i, "files": [{"label": "PDF", "url": "x.pdf", "added": "2026-11-0%d" % i}]} for i in (1, 2, 3, 4, 5)]}]}
def route(r):
    u = r.request.url
    def j(o, c=200): r.fulfill(status=c, content_type="application/json", body=json.dumps(o))
    if "/api/platform" in u: return j(PLAT)
    if "/api/auth/me" in u: return j({"ok": True, "user": {"id": 7, "name": "Mohammed Ali", "email": "m@x", "admin": False, "scopes": []}})
    if "/api/catalog/me" in u: return j({"ok": True, "profile": {"stage": 1, "department_id": 4046, "department": "طب عام", "college": "كلية طب الزهراء", "university": "جامعة البصرة", "membership": "confirmed"}})
    if "/api/profile/public" in u: return j({"ok": True, "display_name": "أبو علي", "has_avatar": False, "updated_at": 0})
    if "/api/group-chat/rooms" in u: return j({"ok": True, "items": [{"id": 1, "name": "مجموعة المرحلة", "stage_id": 11, "stage": 1, "department_id": 4046, "department": "طب عام", "college": "كلية", "university": "جامعة", "unread": 0, "muted": 0}], "requests": []})
    if "/api/group-chat/messages" in u: return j({"ok": True, "items": [
        {"id": 1, "group_id": 1, "sender_id": 8, "sender": "سارة", "av": 0, "body": "[[att]]{\"type\":\"file\",\"title\":\"المحاضرة 1\",\"href\":\"course.html?id=anat&dept=4046#lec-1\"}\nانظروا", "created_at": 1700000000000, "reply_to": None},
        {"id": 2, "group_id": 1, "sender_id": 7, "sender": "أبو علي", "av": 0, "body": "شكراً", "created_at": 1700000060000, "reply_to": 1, "reply_sender": "سارة", "reply_body": "[[att]]{}\nانظروا"},
        {"id": 3, "group_id": 1, "sender_id": 8, "sender": "سارة", "av": 0, "body": "", "deleted_at": 1700000070000, "created_at": 1700000065000, "reply_to": None}], "has_more": False, "removed_count": 1})
    if "/api/dm/threads" in u: return j({"ok": True, "items": [{"peer": {"id": 8, "name": "سارة", "role": "student", "av": 0}, "last": {"body": "هلا", "at": 1700000000000, "mine": False}, "unread": 1}], "me": {"id": 7, "mod": False}})
    if "/api/dm/messages" in u: return j({"ok": True, "items": [{"id": 1, "sender_id": 8, "body": "هلا", "created_at": 1700000000000}], "gone": [], "now": 1, "peer": {"id": 8, "name": "سارة", "role": "student", "av": 0}, "blocked": False, "me": 7})
    if "/api/" in u or u.endswith("uploads.js"): return j({}, 404)
    r.continue_()
res = []
def ck(name, ok): res.append(ok); print(("PASS " if ok else "FAIL ") + name)
with sync_playwright() as p:
    b = p.chromium.launch()
    for w in (320, 360, 390, 430):
        c = b.new_context(service_workers="block", viewport={"width": w, "height": 800}, locale="ar")
        c.add_init_script("localStorage.setItem('ms.last', JSON.stringify('anat')); localStorage.setItem('ms.read', JSON.stringify({anat:[1,2]}))")
        pg = c.new_page(); errs = []; pg.on("pageerror", lambda e: errs.append(str(e)))
        pg.route("**/*", lambda r: route(r) if ("/api/" in r.request.url or r.request.url.endswith("uploads.js")) else r.continue_())
        pg.goto("http://127.0.0.1:8793/platform.html?dept=4046&stage=1"); pg.wait_for_selector(".mv-nav")
        ck("%d continue card with real progress" % w, pg.locator(".mv-continue").is_visible() and "2 من 5" in pg.locator(".mv-continue").inner_text())
        ck("%d nav 5 items" % w, pg.locator(".mv-nav > *").count() == 5)
        ck("%d chat in bottom nav" % w, pg.locator('.mv-nav a[href="group-chat.html"]').count() == 1)
        ck("%d no horizontal scroll" % w, pg.evaluate("document.documentElement.scrollWidth <= window.innerWidth + 1"))
        meta = pg.locator(".mv-meta").inner_text()
        ck("%d meta line: uni · college · stage, once" % w, "جامعة البصرة" in meta and "كلية طب الزهراء" in meta and "المرحلة 1" in meta and meta.count("كلية") == 1)
        cols = pg.evaluate("getComputedStyle(document.querySelector('.mv-grid')).gridTemplateColumns.split(' ').length")
        ck("%d tile columns (2 below 420, 4 above)" % w, cols == (2 if w < 420 else 4))
        ck("%d tiles touch height >=48" % w, all(pg.locator(".mv-tile").nth(i).bounding_box()["height"] >= 48 for i in range(8)))
        ck("%d hero compact (<=140px)" % w, pg.locator(".hero-text").bounding_box()["height"] <= 140)
        ck("%d grid tiles 8" % w, pg.locator(".mv-tile").count() == 8)
        ck("%d dark by default" % w, pg.evaluate("document.documentElement.getAttribute('data-theme')") == "dark")
        ck("%d header title is dept" % w, pg.locator(".mv-title").inner_text() == "طب عام")
        ck("%d latest shows 3 real files" % w, pg.locator("#latestList .latest-item:visible").count() == 3)
        ck("%d latest has 'show all' in header" % w, pg.locator("#latest .section-head .mv-more").is_visible())
        ck("%d no trailing separator in lecture sub" % w, not any(t.strip().endswith("·") for t in pg.locator("#latestList .latest-sub").all_inner_texts()))
        ck("%d original quick section hidden" % w, not pg.locator('section[aria-label="الوصول السريع"]').is_visible())
        nav_box = pg.locator(".mv-nav").bounding_box(); ck("%d nav at bottom" % w, abs(nav_box["y"] + nav_box["height"] - 800) < 2)
        if w == 390:
            pg.click('.mv-nav [data-v="semesters"]'); pg.wait_for_timeout(200)
            ck("subjects view", pg.get_attribute("body", "data-mv") == "subjects" and pg.locator("#subjects").is_visible() and not pg.locator("#home").is_visible())
            ck("deep link kept", "dept=4046" in pg.url and pg.url.endswith("#semesters"))
            pg.go_back(); pg.wait_for_timeout(200); ck("back returns home view", pg.get_attribute("body", "data-mv") == "home")
            pg.click('.mv-nav [data-v="latest"]'); pg.wait_for_timeout(200)
            ck("lectures view shows all", pg.get_attribute("body", "data-mv") == "lectures" and pg.locator("#latestList .latest-item:visible").count() >= 4)
            pg.click('.mv-tile[href="#tools"]') if False else pg.evaluate("location.hash='#tools'"); pg.wait_for_timeout(200)
            ck("tools view", pg.locator("#tools").is_visible() and not pg.locator("#latest").is_visible())
            pg.click('.mv-nav button:last-child'); pg.wait_for_selector(".mv-sheet", state="visible")
            pg.wait_for_timeout(300)
            ck("account sheet shows display name + email", "أبو علي" in pg.locator(".mv-acct").inner_text() and "m@x" in pg.locator(".mv-acct").inner_text())
            ck("account sheet has photo/name editor", pg.locator(".mv-pub input[type=text]").count() == 1)
            ck("account facts show university", "جامعة البصرة" in pg.locator(".mv-facts").inner_text())
            ck("no admin link for student", pg.locator('.mv-sheet a[href="admin.html"]').count() == 0)
            pg.keyboard.press("Escape"); ck("sheet closes", not pg.locator(".mv-sheet").is_visible())
            pg.screenshot(path="/tmp/claude-0/mv_home_390.png")
        ck("%d no page errors" % w, not [e for e in errs if "EN is not defined" not in e])
        c.close()
    # الحاسوب لا يتأثر
    c = b.new_context(service_workers="block", viewport={"width": 1280, "height": 800}); pg = c.new_page()
    pg.route("**/*", lambda r: route(r) if ("/api/" in r.request.url or r.request.url.endswith("uploads.js")) else r.continue_())
    pg.goto("http://127.0.0.1:8793/platform.html?dept=4046&stage=1"); pg.wait_for_selector(".mv-nav", state="attached")
    ck("desktop: bottom nav hidden", not pg.locator(".mv-nav").is_visible())
    ck("desktop: sections all visible", pg.locator("#semesters").is_visible() and pg.locator("#latest").is_visible())
    # صفحات المادة والكورس: شريط التنقل حاضر وروابطه تحفظ القسم
    c = b.new_context(service_workers="block", viewport={"width": 390, "height": 800}); pg = c.new_page(); errs = []; pg.on("pageerror", lambda e: errs.append(str(e)))
    pg.route("**/*", lambda r: route(r) if ("/api/" in r.request.url or r.request.url.endswith("uploads.js")) else r.continue_())
    pg.goto("http://127.0.0.1:8793/platform.html?dept=4046&stage=1"); pg.wait_for_selector(".mv-nav")
    pg.goto("http://127.0.0.1:8793/course.html?id=anat&dept=4046&stage=1"); pg.wait_for_selector(".mv-nav")
    pg.goto("http://127.0.0.1:8793/semester.html?id=11&dept=4046&stage=1"); pg.wait_for_selector(".mv-nav")
    bg = pg.evaluate("getComputedStyle(document.body).backgroundColor")
    ck("semester page: dark background in dark mode", bg in ("rgb(15, 26, 40)",))
    ck("semester page: one title in header", not pg.locator(".semester-brand").is_visible() and pg.locator(".mv-title").is_visible())
    ck("semester page: headings readable", pg.evaluate("(()=>{const h=document.querySelector('.sem-title');if(!h)return true;const c=getComputedStyle(h).color;return c!=='rgb(15, 26, 40)'})()"))
    pg.goto("http://127.0.0.1:8793/course.html?id=anat&dept=4046&stage=1"); pg.wait_for_selector(".mv-nav")
    ck("course page: nav present", pg.locator(".mv-nav > *").count() == 5)
    ck("course page: nav keeps dept", "dept=4046" in (pg.get_attribute('.mv-nav a[data-v="semesters"]', "href") or ""))
    ck("course page: nav marks subjects", pg.get_attribute('.mv-nav [data-v="semesters"]', "aria-current") == "page")
    ck("course page: no h-scroll", pg.evaluate("document.documentElement.scrollWidth <= window.innerWidth + 1"))
    pg.evaluate("document.getElementById('viewer').showModal()"); pg.wait_for_timeout(200)
    vb = pg.locator("#viewer").bounding_box()
    ck("viewer fills phone screen", vb["width"] >= 389 and vb["height"] >= 799)
    ck("viewer buttons touch size", all(pg.locator("#viewer .viewer-bar .btn").nth(i).bounding_box()["height"] >= 40 for i in range(3)))
    ck("viewer bar no overflow", pg.evaluate("(()=>{const b=document.querySelector('#viewer .viewer-bar');return b.scrollWidth<=b.clientWidth+1})()"))
    pg.evaluate("document.getElementById('viewer').close()")
    ck("course page: no errors", not [e for e in errs if "EN is not defined" not in e])
    c.close()
    # الدردشة: صور/أسماء، مرفق، حذف بلا أثر، رسالة خاصة
    c = b.new_context(service_workers="block", viewport={"width": 390, "height": 800}); pg = c.new_page(); errs = []; pg.on("pageerror", lambda e: errs.append(str(e)))
    pg.route("**/*", lambda r: route(r) if "/api/" in r.request.url else r.continue_())
    pg.goto("http://127.0.0.1:8793/group-chat.html"); pg.wait_for_selector(".message")
    ck("chat: registered-stage banner", "مرحلتك المسجّلة" in pg.locator("#profileBanner").inner_text())
    ck("chat: deleted message leaves no trace", pg.locator(".message").count() == 2 and "حُذفت" not in pg.locator("#conversation").inner_text())
    ck("chat: attachment card", pg.locator(".att-card").count() == 1)
    ck("chat: reply quote hides raw attachment", "[[att]]" not in pg.locator("#conversation").inner_text())
    pg.locator(".message:not(.mine) .msg-text").first.click()
    ck("chat: private message action", pg.locator('.bubble.show-actions button:has-text("رسالة خاصة")').count() == 1)
    pg.click("#attachBtn"); pg.wait_for_selector("#sheetList .sheet-row")
    ck("chat: attach sheet lists department files", pg.locator("#sheetList .sheet-row").count() >= 1)
    pg.locator("#sheetList .sheet-row").first.click(); ck("chat: pending attachment shown", pg.locator("#attachBar").is_visible())
    ck("chat: no h-scroll", pg.evaluate("document.documentElement.scrollWidth <= window.innerWidth + 1"))
    pg.goto("http://127.0.0.1:8793/dm.html"); pg.wait_for_selector(".dm-row")
    ck("dm: thread list", pg.locator(".dm-row").count() == 1 and pg.locator(".dm-row .unread").inner_text() == "1")
    pg.click(".dm-row"); pg.wait_for_selector("#log .message")
    ck("dm: thread opens", "u=8" in pg.url and pg.locator("#dmTitle").inner_text() == "سارة")
    ck("chat/dm: no errors", not errs)
    c.close()
    b.close()
print("%d/%d" % (sum(res), len(res))); sys.exit(0 if all(res) else 1)
